### GET request to example server
GET http://localhost:59557/__admin/mappings

###
POST http://localhost:59557/__admin/mappings
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Request": {
        "Path": "/shipping-quote",
        "Methods": ["GET"]
    },
    "Response": {
        "StatusCode": 200,
        "BodyAsJson": { "carrier": "Acme Freight", "cost": 12.50, "estimatedDays": 3 }
    }
}

